---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';

const meta = {
  title: "Hufu · 虎符输入法 · macOS 中文输入法",
  description: "虎符输入法，只做虎码的 macOS 输入法。开源，注重隐私，基于 librime。",
};
---

<Base locale="zh" slug="" title={meta.title} description={meta.description} application>
  <main id="main"><section class="hero wrap"><h1>中文常新，<br class="hero-break">自在表达。</h1><p class="hero-sub">只做虎码的 macOS 输入法。开源，注重隐私，基于 librime。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/download/">安装与下载 <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a><a class="button secondary" href="/docs/">使用文档</a></div><p class="release-note"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="nowrap">macOS 15.0+ · 0.1.0 预览版可下载</span> <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <span class="nowrap">未签名，首次打开需右键打开</span></p></section><section class="stage-section" aria-labelledby="stage-caption"><div class="stage wrap"><div class="theme-stage theme-render-stage"><img src="/themes/renders/hufu_light-linear.png" width="524" height="47" loading="lazy" alt="虎符输入法候选窗：虎码编码 huma，候选 虎码、虎符、虎"><img src="/themes/renders/hufu_dark-linear.png" width="524" height="47" loading="lazy" alt="" hidden></div><p class="theme-note">候选窗实际渲染 · 虎码编码 huma → 虎码</p></div></section><div class="home-sections wrap"><section class="feature-section feature-split" data-track-area="home-snippets" aria-labelledby="snippets-heading"><div class="section-copy"><h2 id="snippets-heading">证件、号码和邮箱，按一个键。</h2><p>手机号、邮箱、地址分好类存着。打字时长按 ⌥ 再按 1，按 A、S、D 直接上屏。</p></div><div class="snippet-demo" data-snippet-demo><div class="snippet-scene"><p class="snippet-message">方便留个电话和邮箱吗？</p><div class="ime-panel snippet-panel" data-view="phrases" style="--corner-radius:10px;--hilited-corner-radius:6px;--border-width:7px;--border-height:6px;--spacing:8px;--line-spacing:4px;--font-point:17px;--label-font-point:13px;--comment-font-point:13px;--ime-text-font:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, sans-serif;--ime-label-font:&quot;SF Pro Rounded&quot;, -apple-system, system-ui, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, sans-serif"><ol class="ime-tabs" aria-label="常用语分类"><li class="on"><button type="button" data-snippet-tab="0" aria-pressed="true"><b>1</b>手机号</button></li><li><button type="button" data-snippet-tab="1" aria-pressed="false"><b>2</b>邮箱</button></li><li><button type="button" data-snippet-tab="2" aria-pressed="false"><b>3</b>地址</button></li></ol><ol class="ime-list ime-cells" data-snippet-list="0" aria-label="手机号"><li class="on"><button type="button" data-snippet-item data-key="A" data-value="+852 6100 6100"><b>A</b><span>+852 6100 6100</span><svg class="snippet-check" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8"></path></svg></button></li><li><button type="button" data-snippet-item data-key="S" data-value="+86 139 1234 5678"><b>S</b><span>+86 139 1234 5678</span><svg class="snippet-check" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8"></path></svg></button></li><li><button type="button" data-snippet-item data-key="D" data-value="+1 (415) 555-0100"><b>D</b><span>+1 (415) 555-0100</span><svg class="snippet-check" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8"></path></svg></button></li></ol><ol class="ime-list ime-cells" data-snippet-list="1" aria-label="邮箱" hidden><li class="on"><button type="button" data-snippet-item data-key="A" data-value="hello@example.com"><b>A</b><span>hello@example.com</span><svg class="snippet-check" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8"></path></svg></button></li><li><button type="button" data-snippet-item data-key="S" data-value="luolei@work.example"><b>S</b><span>luolei@work.example</span><svg class="snippet-check" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8"></path></svg></button></li><li><button type="button" data-snippet-item data-key="D" data-value="me@personal.example"><b>D</b><span>me@personal.example</span><svg class="snippet-check" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8"></path></svg></button></li></ol><ol class="ime-list ime-cells" data-snippet-list="2" aria-label="地址" hidden><li class="on"><button type="button" data-snippet-item data-key="A" data-value="香港中环皇后大道中 99 号"><b>A</b><span>香港中环皇后大道中 99 号</span><svg class="snippet-check" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8"></path></svg></button></li><li><button type="button" data-snippet-item data-key="S" data-value="成都市锦江区春熙路 1 号"><b>S</b><span>成都市锦江区春熙路 1 号</span><svg class="snippet-check" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8"></path></svg></button></li></ol><p class="ime-hint">字母键上屏 · 数字切换分类 · ↑↓ 移动</p></div><div class="inputbar snippet-input"><p class="field" tabindex="0" role="textbox" aria-readonly="true" aria-label="常用语输入预览"><span data-snippet-output></span><span class="caret"></span></p><span class="ib-send" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 18V6M7 11l5-5 5 5"></path></svg></span></div></div><div class="preview-caption"><span>可交互预览 · 示例数据</span><button type="button" class="text-button" data-snippet-play aria-pressed="true" data-play="播放演示" data-pause="暂停演示">暂停演示</button><button type="button" class="text-button" data-snippet-reset>重置</button></div><p class="sr-only" data-snippet-status aria-live="polite"></p></div></section><section class="feature-section feature-centered" data-track-area="home-themes" aria-labelledby="themes-heading"><div class="section-copy"><h2 id="themes-heading">多套配色，随心定义。</h2><p>在官网挑好，点一下就导入虎符输入法设置。</p></div><div class="home-theme-widget" data-home-themes><div class="home-theme-tabs" role="group" aria-label="候选窗主题"><button type="button" data-home-theme="hufu_light" data-name="虎符浅色" aria-pressed="true">虎符浅色</button><button type="button" data-home-theme="hufu_dark" data-name="虎符深色" aria-pressed="false">虎符深色</button><button type="button" data-home-theme="graphite" data-name="石墨" aria-pressed="false">石墨</button><button type="button" data-home-theme="midnight" data-name="午夜" aria-pressed="false">午夜</button><button type="button" data-home-theme="sakura" data-name="樱花" aria-pressed="false">樱花</button><button type="button" data-home-theme="matcha" data-name="抹茶" aria-pressed="false">抹茶</button><button type="button" data-home-theme="nord" data-name="北境" aria-pressed="false">北境</button><button type="button" data-home-theme="paper" data-name="纸墨" aria-pressed="false">纸墨</button></div><div class="home-theme-layout" role="group" aria-label="候选排列"><button type="button" data-home-layout="linear" aria-pressed="true">横排</button><button type="button" data-home-layout="stacked" aria-pressed="false">竖排</button></div><div class="home-theme-pair"><div class="home-theme-desktop desktop-light"><img data-home-render src="/themes/renders/hufu_light-linear.png" width="524" height="47" loading="lazy" alt="虎符浅色 · 横排候选窗"><span>浅色桌面</span></div><div class="home-theme-desktop desktop-dark"><img data-home-render src="/themes/renders/hufu_light-linear.png" width="524" height="47" loading="lazy" alt="虎符浅色 · 横排候选窗"><span>深色桌面</span></div></div><p class="preview-caption">App 实际渲染</p><a class="theme-museum-entry" href="/themes/"><span class="theme-museum-mark"><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m3 8 9-5 9 5H3Zm2 3v7m5-7v7m4-7v7m5-7v7M3 21h18M4 18h16"></path></svg></span><span class="theme-museum-label">主题博物馆</span><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class="feature-section feature-centered" data-track-area="home-stats" aria-labelledby="stats-heading"><div class="section-copy"><h2 id="stats-heading">这一年打了多少字。</h2><p>字数、时段、用得最多的应用和词。只存在这台 Mac 上，可以随时清空。</p><p class="section-note">默认关闭，开启后开始记录。</p></div><figure class="feature-figure stats-figure"><div class="feature-window"><img class="screenshot-light" src="/screenshots/settings/stats-light.png" width="2160" height="1440" loading="lazy" alt="Hufu 输入统计设置窗口"><img class="screenshot-dark" src="/screenshots/settings/stats-dark.png" width="2160" height="1440" loading="lazy" alt="Hufu 输入统计设置窗口"></div><figcaption>App 实际截图 · 示例数据</figcaption></figure></section><section class="feature-section feature-split apps-section" data-track-area="home-apps" aria-labelledby="apps-heading"><div class="section-copy"><h2 id="apps-heading">终端里打英文，微信里打中文。</h2><p>每个应用记住自己的输入状态。第一次打开时扫描一遍已装的应用，推荐好默认值。</p></div><figure class="feature-figure"><div class="feature-window apps-crop"><img class="screenshot-light" src="/screenshots/settings/apps-light.png" width="2160" height="1440" loading="lazy" alt="Hufu 按应用设置中英文，上半部分"><img class="screenshot-dark" src="/screenshots/settings/apps-dark.png" width="2160" height="1440" loading="lazy" alt="Hufu 按应用设置中英文，上半部分"></div><figcaption>App 实际截图</figcaption></figure></section><section class="feature-section feature-split ai-section" data-track-area="home-ai" aria-labelledby="ai-heading"><div class="ai-scene"><div class="ai-note"><div class="ai-note-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>备忘录</span></div><p class="ai-document">给 Lena 的回复<br><mark>我想去吃潮州菜，七点在中环见？</mark><span class="caret"></span></p></div><div class="ime-panel ring ai-results" data-view="result" style="--corner-radius:10px;--hilited-corner-radius:6px;--border-width:7px;--border-height:6px;--spacing:8px;--line-spacing:4px;--font-point:17px;--label-font-point:13px;--comment-font-point:13px;--ime-text-font:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, -apple-system, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, sans-serif;--ime-label-font:&quot;SF Pro Rounded&quot;, -apple-system, system-ui, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, sans-serif"><ol class="ime-list ime-results"><li class="on"><b>1</b><span class="ime-out"><em>翻译</em>How about Chiuchow food tonight? Meet in Central at 7?</span></li><li><b>2</b><span class="ime-out"><em>润色</em>今晚去吃潮州菜吧，七点在中环见，可以吗？</span></li><li><b>3</b><span class="ime-out"><em>粤语</em>今晚去食潮州嘢，七點喺中環見？</span></li></ol></div><p class="preview-caption">示例结果 · 不联网</p></div><div class="section-copy"><h2 id="ai-heading">翻译和润色，<br>在光标处完成。</h2><p>选中一段话，按 ⌃⌥P 或长按 ⌥ 打开快捷菜单选「AI 处理」。只处理选中的这一段。</p></div></section><section class="feature-section settings-pair" data-track-area="home-settings" aria-label="外观与词库"><article><h2><span class="settings-title-line">配色、字号、圆角，</span><span class="settings-title-line">边改边看。</span></h2><figure class="feature-figure"><div class="feature-window"><img class="screenshot-light" src="/screenshots/settings/appearance-light.png" width="2160" height="1440" loading="lazy" alt="外观设置窗口"><img class="screenshot-dark" src="/screenshots/settings/appearance-dark.png" width="2160" height="1440" loading="lazy" alt="外观设置窗口"></div><figcaption>App 实际截图</figcaption></figure></article><article><h2><span class="settings-title-line">单字起步，</span><span class="settings-title-line">词汇按需打开。</span></h2><figure class="feature-figure"><div class="feature-window"><img class="screenshot-light" src="/screenshots/settings/dictionaries-light.png" width="2160" height="1440" loading="lazy" alt="词库设置窗口"><img class="screenshot-dark" src="/screenshots/settings/dictionaries-dark.png" width="2160" height="1440" loading="lazy" alt="词库设置窗口"></div><figcaption>App 实际截图</figcaption></figure></article></section></div><script type="module" src="/assets/home-sections.js" is:inline></script><section class="features wrap" aria-label="特点"><article class="feature"><span class="feature-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m9 7-5 5 5 5m6-10 5 5-5 5"></path></svg></span><h2>基于 RIME，代码开源。</h2><p>只做虎码，基于 librime。可读取现有 RIME 配置，也可从鼠须管导入词库、短语与配色。</p><p class="feature-proof">原创代码 MIT · 依赖保留各自许可</p><a class="text-link feature-link" href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu">GitHub · syhily/hufu <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></article><article class="feature"><span class="feature-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M7 11V8a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v3M6 11h12v9H6Z"></path></svg></span><h2>日常输入，留在本机。</h2><p>组字、候选与个人词频在本机处理，不含遥测。常用语只存本机。输入统计默认关闭。</p><p class="feature-proof">AI 默认用 Apple 端侧模型，是否可用取决于设备、系统设置与地区（中国大陆设备/账号目前不可用）；不可用时可配置自己的 OpenAI 兼容接口（可能计费）。</p><a class="text-link feature-link" href="/privacy/">隐私说明 <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></article><article class="feature"><span class="feature-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M10 4l1.8 4.2L16 10l-4.2 1.8L10 16l-1.8-4.2L4 10l4.2-1.8ZM18 14l.9 2.1L21 17l-2.1.9L18 20l-.9-2.1L15 17l2.1-.9Z"></path></svg></span><h2>需要时，调用 AI。</h2><p>按 ⌃⌥P，或长按 ⌥ 打开快捷菜单选「AI 处理」，翻译或润色指定的文字；也可以添加自己的动作。</p><p class="feature-proof">简繁转换在本机完成，不需要 AI。</p></article><article class="feature"><span class="feature-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M13 3 5 13.5h6L10 21l8-10.5h-6Z"></path></svg></span><h2>常用内容，用按键输入。</h2><p>输入引擎使用原生 librime。常用语可分类，短语可设编码。符号按字母键选择，高频词排在前面。</p><p class="feature-proof">librime 静态内嵌 · 词表构建期预编译 · 首次部署约 1 秒</p></article></section><section class="cta-band wrap" aria-labelledby="cta-heading"><h2 id="cta-heading">装好后，打几个字试试。</h2><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/download/">安装与下载 <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a><a class="button secondary" href="/docs/">使用文档</a></div></section><script type="module" src="/assets/home.js" is:inline></script></main>
</Base>
